      "created_at": "2012-04-13T17:18:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>They sold out of the original prints of the core game, so presumably they’ll need to print more.  Maybe when they reprint it, they’ll update the environments with the new look, which’d be great.  In fact, if they reprint the core set, they would presumably make everything with the new higher quality cardstock, which would make me want to re-purchase the core set even though I already own it.  Diabolical.</p>",
