      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/65b543/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-14T13:39:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is a no brainer in my opinion.  Cards w/art are better than cards without art.  I find myself leaning towards using the Rook City environments instead of the core ones because of the art.  Even though the Rook City ones have a nasty tendency to completely mess us Heroes up.  Especially Rook City.  “Scum &amp; Villainy” &amp; “Ambitious Racketeer” have quickly become some of my favorite cards to hate.</p>",
