      "created_at": "2012-04-14T21:50:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The key to having art on the cards is to be able to easily recognize the card from a distance - which is very important in a game like this, where every card has odd and variant effects… <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
