      "created_at": "2012-04-15T01:09:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Another area where I expect I’m in the minority – I don’t really care that much about the art. Don’t get me wrong, I love it to death and it makes the game more fun and at times it’s helpful to recognize cards at a distance, but it’s frosting and doesn’t influence which environments, villains, heroes I choose to play.</p>",
